# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb
# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

CLAUDE.md
test-geo

# Local secrets for the containerized live-trader (holds POLY_PRIVATE_KEY)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Runtime bind-mount data dirs (docker-compose writes these as the container
# user). feature-recorder CSVs in particular run to 50-130 MB per run, which
# GitHub hard-rejects above 100 MB — one of them blocked a push on 2026-08-20.
# Root-anchored on purpose: analysis/dry-data and analysis/live-data are the
# curated copies and ARE tracked.
/data/
/dry-data/
/feature-data/

# Python bytecode (analysis/__pycache__ was tracked and churns on every run)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
